###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Residuals mix model error and electronic-structure reference differences (Appendix D); the paper reports selection metrics (DFT fraction, normalized gain, retained error mass) and relative-energy MAE differences between selection methods, not per-model MAE/RMSE. Not encoded.
